<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Ryanair at $14.73.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Ryanair at $14.73.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	     Ryanair Holdings Plc</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $14.73</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $12.28 - $14.52</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		     54,167,596</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Morgan Stanley and Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The stock of the Irish airline will debut on both sides of the Atlantic on the Nasdaq National Market and the Irish stock exchange in an initial public offering. In the United States, American Depository shares will be offered, each representing five shares.</p>
